(label "V5C" (at 238.76 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7973bf98-2e3c-587d-aed8-58a1f308f556"))
(text "jank-mini-3. The Waveshare ESP32-S3-LCD-2 joins J15 (its P1) / J16 (its P2) through the bridge strips: +3V3, VBAT (its cell, on its own MX1.25 connector; no cell on this board), VBUS_B (its USB-C VBUS) and 14 GPIOs (parts.GPIO)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "135c6978-35b5-53f9-a832-076968f41a77"))
(text "5 V aux: VIN_B from VBUS_B through D3, or from VBAT through Q1 (off while VBUS_B is up); U18 TPS61023 -> V5A 5.00 V (R134 / R135+R154+R136); U19 clamp 5.83 V behind R145; JP8 MIDI, JP9 CV." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 16.509999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1c046fc2-d2ac-5706-8ae9-59e0c4d94ce8"))
(text "USB: J1 TO ESP (USB-C, the outside loop cable from the LCD-2's own USB-C; VBUS / CC open) -> D+ / D- -> J4 TO DEVICE (USB-C), U5 ESD at J4; J4's VBUS (pads A4 / B9) = the host signal (HOST5 from U21, R93, D16) + C28; Rp 56k on CC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "18f5ac0c-98eb-5e89-bc77-8f5f9c8deba9"))
(text "MIDI OUT 1 (IO13) / 2 (IO9): jack + DIN each, own loops from V5M, AO3400A sinks (UART TX inverted), SRV05-4 at the pins. CLOCK (IO15) / RESET (IO2): 74AHCT04 on V5C, BAV99, 1k. LINE IN: IO7 / IO8 matched networks, LIN_DET IO18." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d9b59b7b-03b5-5ef7-8097-1b37ced31f12"))
